title: "HyperlocalAQ: Multi-Source Air Quality Modeling for Chennai"
abstract: "High-resolution air quality modeling framework integrating 7 APIs (WAQI, NASA FIRMS, Open-Meteo, TomTom, OSM, CAMS, OpenFDA) with hybrid IDW modeling, fire-impact and traffic adjustments, visualized on an interactive Folium map."
